    <item>
      <title>简介 Introduction</title>
      <link>https://NirvanaCeleste.github.io/omori/introduction/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 02 Jul 2026 22:15:00 +0800</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://NirvanaCeleste.github.io/omori/introduction/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;这个网页是基于Github、Cloudflare、DigitalPlat Domains开发的，旨在记录我的学习和开发经历，如OMORI模组《未竟之事》和ACM学习题解等。&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;目前由于知识与能力有限，这个网站会比较简陋，但是理论上这个网站应该在任何地方都可以访问，便于打破国内外限制。&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;如果你是来自OMORI模组制作圈的朋友，请关注我的社交账号：&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;油管: &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.youtube.com/@OmoriModUnwrittenStory&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;https://www.youtube.com/@OmoriModUnwrittenStory&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;推特: &lt;a href=&#34;https://x.com/NirvanaCelesteZ&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;https://x.com/NirvanaCelesteZ&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;B站: &lt;a href=&#34;https://space.bilibili.com/414300544&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;https://space.bilibili.com/414300544&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This website is built with GitHub, Cloudflare and DigitalPlat Domains.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;It documents my learning and development journeys, including the OMORI mod Unwritten Story and solutions to ACM practice problems.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Due to my limited knowledge and technical skills, the site looks rather basic at the moment.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;In theory, however, it can be accessed anywhere in the world to bypass regional network restrictions between domestic and overseas networks.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
